• You start your day at North Beach (arrival at 09:00) and plan to be at Union Square by 16:00. With a 7‐minute trip from North Beach to Union Square, you can depart around 15:53 so you arrive right on time.
• Emily is available at Union Square from 16:00 to 17:15. This gives you a 75‐minute window—comfortably exceeding the 45‐minute minimum requirement.
• After meeting Emily, you have until Margaret appears at Russian Hill at 19:00. Departing Union Square immediately after your meeting (or even at 17:15) and taking the direct 13‐minute route to Russian Hill (Union Square to Russian Hill) means you’d arrive well before 19:00. Although you might wait at Russian Hill, you can then meet Margaret for the full 120 minutes from 19:00 to 21:00.
• This schedule meets all constraints and allows you to “meet as many friends as possible” within the given day.
